+          - [Ubuntu arm64 (CPU)](https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}/releases/download/${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}/llama-${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}-bin-ubuntu-arm64.tar.gz)
+
+          **Linux (CUDA):**
