+          - [Linux x64 (CUDA 12.8)](https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}/releases/download/${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}/llama-${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}-bin-linux-cuda-12.8-x64.tar.gz)
+          - [Linux x64 (CUDA 13.3)](https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}/releases/download/${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}/llama-${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}-bin-linux-cuda-13.3-x64.tar.gz)
+
+          **Linux (Vulkan):**
