+          - [Ubuntu arm64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}/releases/download/${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}/llama-${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}-bin-ubuntu-vulkan-arm64.tar.gz)
+
+          **Linux (AMD):**
