+          - [Windows arm64 (CPU)](https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}/releases/download/${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}/llama-${{ steps.tag.outputs.name }}-bin-win-cpu-arm64.zip)
+
+          **Windows (CUDA):**
